      "rationale": "IVD identifies front-end as initiator with copeland_score 3 and own_code_stack_trace. It has the highest IVD ranking and no emitter_exception flag, but it is an entry-like component; however, according to rules, entry components are not root causes. Among source_candidates, 'carts' has high anomaly magnitude and error/log/cpu anomalies but its IVD role is ambiguous. 'orders' has many logs and errors, but IVD marks it as victim. 'queue-master' has emitter_exception_no_dependency in IVD, but copeland_score only 1 and lower ranking. Since IVD verdict provides initiator with copeland_score > 0, we must select it. Despite front-end being an entry component, the directive to pick the initiator from IVD overrides general rule about entry components not being root cause. Therefore, root_component is front-end.",
